<title>USA: Trump Hotels stake held by Oppenheimer.</title>
<headline>Trump Hotels stake held by Oppenheimer.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oppenheimer Group Inc said in a Securities and Exchange Commission filing on Thursday that it holds a 19.99 percent stake in Trump Hotels and Casino Resorts Inc or 4,825,930 common shares.</p>
<p>Oppenheimer disclosed its latest position on Trump in a 13G filing.</p>
<p>Filings under 13G are usually made by institutions and large investors with &quot;passive&quot; investment objectives in a company. Unlike 13D filings, these reports do not list the latest transactions.</p>
</text>
